Hey, I just had an idea. This thread is quite large. Let us all (poi
owning video cameras or webcams) make small video clips looking cheery
and saying something like ".i mi tavla fo la lojban", and another
sentence of your choosing, possibly around the theme of why you like
lojban (but not necessarily restricted to that). Then when we have ten
or so, we upload them somewhere, someone can edit them together and we
can upload the result to youtube. Not necessarily as a reply to the
aforementioned This Guy, but as a simple and fun community project.
Thoughts?

